  <div class="head"><span><b>Investors</b> · deck 6</span><span>v1.0 · 7 November 2026</span></div>
  <div class="inner" style="max-width:1080px">
    <div class="kicker">The technology · sgit, RiskMandate, agent behaviour policies</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:100px">Twenty agents for every person, and every one in its lane.</h1>
    <p class="lead">What makes PrompTugal possible is not more AI. It is the control: a key for every agent, privacy by default, and a written mandate whose gap is measured every hour.</p>
  </div>
