<!-- 3 · a control problem -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The real problem</b></span><span>03</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Capacity is cheap. Control is not.</div>
  <h2>Adding agents is easy. Keeping twenty of them in their lane is the problem.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:64px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">01 · WHO</div><h3>Who did this?</h3><p>Every commit, article and message has to say which agent made it, and prove it, or nobody can be held to anything.</p><div class="answer">THE ANSWER: A KEY PER AGENT (sgit)</div></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">02 · WHAT IT SEES</div><h3>Who can read what?</h3><p>Twenty agents share one repository. They must not share their secrets, the drafts in progress or a reader's data.</p><div class="answer">THE ANSWER: PRIVATE BY DEFAULT (sgit)</div></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">03 · WHAT IT MAY DO</div><h3>Is it in its lane?</h3><p>What each agent can reach, what it was authorised to do, and the gap between the two, written down and checked.</p><div class="answer">THE ANSWER: THE MANDATE (RiskMandate)</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:56px;max-width:1680px">Dinis Cruz: <b>"The only way that keeps us all in control, keeps them in their lane and makes sure everything is working is RiskMandate."</b></p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The technology · quote: Dinis Cruz, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · the stack -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The stack</b></span><span>04</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">From the key to the published page</div>
  <h2>Six layers make one newsroom of people and agents.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 640" width="1680" height="640" style="margin-top:40px">
    <text x="0" y="22" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">THE LAYER · WHAT IT DOES TODAY</text>
    <text x="1210" y="22" class="mono" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">THE NEXT PHASE</text>
    <g transform="translate(0,40)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1160" height="86" fill="#c52830"/>
      <text x="30" y="38" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">PrompTugal.news</text><text x="30" y="70" font-size="21" fill="#f8e4df">the publication: sourced facts, signed articles, 426 automatic releases</text>
      <line x1="1160" y1="43" x2="1200" y2="43" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><text x="1210" y="38" font-size="22" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">More editions, more events</text><text x="1210" y="68" font-size="20" fill="#595c64">the same stack, configured again</text>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(0,138)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1160" height="86" fill="#121317"/>
      <text x="30" y="38" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#f6f3ec">The workflows</text><text x="30" y="70" font-size="21" fill="#c8c4ba">hourly runs, passes, the gate, CI that numbers and deploys every release</text>
      <line x1="1160" y1="43" x2="1200" y2="43" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><text x="1210" y="38" font-size="22" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">More agents per person</text><text x="1210" y="68" font-size="20" fill="#595c64">once the gap is measured, not guessed</text>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(0,236)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1160" height="86" fill="#006600"/>
      <text x="30" y="38" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">Agent Behaviour Policies</text><text x="30" y="70" font-size="21" fill="#e2eedf">ours: one per agent, deny by default; hooks, run reports, an hourly review</text>
      <line x1="1160" y1="43" x2="1200" y2="43" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><text x="1210" y="38" font-size="22" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">Sold to customers</text><text x="1210" y="68" font-size="20" fill="#595c64">who deploy the team themselves</text>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(0,334)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1160" height="86" fill="#e2eedf" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="30" y="38" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">RiskMandate</text><text x="30" y="70" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">the language and the measure: reach, mandate, gap, barrier</text>
      <line x1="1160" y1="43" x2="1200" y2="43" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><text x="1210" y="38" font-size="22" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">Boundaries that bind</text><text x="1210" y="68" font-size="20" fill="#595c64">SHarness, open source, in progress</text>
    </g>
    <g transform="translate(0,432)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="1160" height="86" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#1f4fa8" stroke-width="3"/>
      <text x="30" y="38" class="serif" font-size="32" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">sgit</text><text x="30" y="70" font-size="21" fill="#3f424a">keys and signatures for agents, encrypted vaults, read keys, append lanes</text>
      <line x1="1160" y1="43" x2="1200" y2="43" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"/><text x="1210" y="38" font-size="22" fill="#121317" font-weight="600">Keys per door</text><text x="1210" y="68" font-size="20" fill="#595c64">and the rotation sgit says it lacks</text>
    </g>
