    <circle cx="1060" cy="70" r="16" fill="#121317"/><text x="1086" y="64" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Trusted, sourced news</text><text x="1086" y="92" font-size="19" fill="#595c64">what the reader wants</text>
    <circle cx="720" cy="200" r="22" fill="#006600"/><text x="690" y="190" font-size="22" font-weight="600" fill="#121317" text-anchor="end">The team and its workflows</text><text x="690" y="218" font-size="19" fill="#595c64" text-anchor="end">twenty agents per person, every hour</text>
